[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4251240703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118599#issuecomment-4251240703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118599","id":4251240703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79ZMj_","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T10:27:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T10:27:10Z","body":"So to be sure I understand correctly, the issue only happens if forcefully disabling browser micorophone preprocessing with a \"hacky\" script like you described? That would make this bug fairly low priority / unlikely to be widespread, but we can still consider merging a simple clamping change.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4251240703/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4251447910","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118599#issuecomment-4251447910","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118599","id":4251447910,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79Z_Jm","user":{"login":"r3square","id":74556856,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTU2ODU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74556856?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square","html_url":"https://github.com/r3square","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r3square/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T11:04:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T11:04:06Z","body":"Yes, the bug is most likely to occur when disabling browser microphone preprocessing, since that's the scenario where web audio input can exceed the -1.0 to 1.0 range. That said, since web input isn't strictly guaranteed to stay within that range regardless, not clamping it is technically leaving the door open for issues in other cases too.\n\nThe reason why I made this script is that Godot doesn't currently support it as a built-in option, so as of right now this is the only way to do it. As for why I want to disable preprocessing, it's because I'm working on a cross-platform game that requires raw microphone input, and I noticed that Web has built-in audio effects enabled by default (like noise removal), which I do not want. (this could also be a feature request)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4251447910/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]